                <pb facs="0421" n="333" xml:id="pg333"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. White to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1904-04-27"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">April 27,
                    1904</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. White reports that Lord Lansdowne has addressed a note to the Russian
                    ambassador in London embodying a reservation similar to the reply of the United
                    States to the Russian declaration respecting wireless telegraphy which Mr. White
                    communicated to him yesterday.)</p>
            </div>
